## Instrument 6 — Decision split (`[DECISION]` logging)

**Not a gate.** Log-only, permanently, until the three layers have separate consumers.

**Graduation criterion (to actually splitting the code):** ≥ **100 entries** logged with all
three records populated, and a demonstrated case where the three disagree usefully — i.e. at
least one session where alpha was right and the instrument was wrong, or vice versa, and the
log makes that visible. If the three records never diverge in an informative way, the split is
bookkeeping and not worth the refactor.

